cff-version: 1.4.1
message: "If you use Teamwork in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Nidvue Teamwork: autonomous multi-agent project teams"
abstract: >-
  Nidvue Teamwork turns one prompt into a self-organising team of AI agents that plans,
  builds, tests and reviews a project until every acceptance criterion is
  verified. It ships as a Pi skill, an installable standard-library-only Python
  package, and a markdown workspace format with a hash-chained audit ledger.
